{%- comment -%}
  Figma: Components Atoms / Block / Heading (2170:25569): heading/2
  Landing block (private: the underscore keeps it out of every other section; only the Landing columns and tabs list it).
  Top and bottom padding are settings on the Figma Spacing scale (spacing/N = N x 4px), as pt-N / pb-N (Hendrik, 24 Nov).
  size          the text style from lg: any Heading or Serif heading style (Hero headline: heading-1; no Display sizes, Hendrik 24 Nov)
  size_mobile   the text style below lg (Hero headline: heading-1)
  tag           h1 to h6, or p for a heading look without a heading in the page outline
  The classes are text-{size}; tailwind.input.css generates them with @source inline.
  Colour comes from the section (Text, or Text inverse on the Hero photo).
{%- endcomment -%}
<div class="landing-block min-w-0 pt-{{ block.settings.padding_top }} pb-{{ block.settings.padding_bottom }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  {%- liquid
    assign tag = block.settings.tag | default: 'h2'
    assign size = block.settings.size | default: 'heading-2'
    assign size_mobile = block.settings.size_mobile | default: size
  -%}
  <{{ tag }} class="text-{{ size_mobile }} lg:text-{{ size }}">{{ block.settings.heading }}</{{ tag }}>
</div>

